{"product_id":"5-minute-princess-stories-5-minute-stories","title":"5-Minute Princess Stories (5-Minute Stories)","description":"\u003cp\u003ePrincesses are often royally busy, but they always have time to help a lost puppy, invite a new friend to tea, or even cheer up a little dragon! Each of these twelve stories is the perfect length for reading aloud in about five minutes, making them perfect for jam-packed days. This treasury stars all the Disney princessesincluding Tiana and Rapunzeland features a padded cover, and beautiful full-page and spot illustrations. Now the princesses' adventures are the royal choice before bed, on the go, or any moment!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 197 x 267\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Disney Press Staff\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781423146575\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 192\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45578836279449,"sku":"5RD9781423146575","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6876365a79335-5-Minute-Princess-Stories-5-Minute-Stories-Disney-Press-Staff-_1.jpg?v=1753120569","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/5-minute-princess-stories-5-minute-stories","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}